### The form page
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Submit the form the way a browser does
POST http://localhost:3000/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

street=Maple&pet=Biscuit

### Missing a field → expect 400 (solution 4)
POST http://localhost:3000/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

street=Maple

### Script in the input → should come back as text, not run (solution 4)
POST http://localhost:3000/submit
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

street=<script>alert(1)</script>&pet=Rex
